# Human-labeled examples calibrate the model judge against product expectations.
{"name":"good concise bounded health answer","input":"Is CI/CD green?","response":{"text":"CI is green; CD is waiting for approval.","markdown":"**CI is green; CD is waiting for approval.**\n\nAll 89 CI jobs passed for current `main`. The release job is paused at pack-registry approval; no deployment failure is reported. [Open the run](https://github.com/example/actions/runs/1)"},"want_pass":true,"min_mean_score":4}
{"name":"good direct uncertainty","input":"Is production healthy?","response":{"text":"Host checks are healthy; end-to-end health is unverified.","markdown":"**Host checks are healthy; end-to-end health is unverified.**\n\nBoth declared hosts are responsive and their containers are running. Database latency, customer transactions, and SLO impact were not checked, so I cannot call the whole system healthy."},"want_pass":true,"min_mean_score":4}
{"name":"good natural task acknowledgement","input":"Can you fix the typo and open a PR?","response":{"text":"I can take that on.","markdown":"I can take that on.","sections":["*Fix the typo and open a draft PR*\nRepository: Emisar (`emisar`)"],"actions":[{"id":"start_task","label":"Start task","value":"source","style":"primary","confirm":"Start this task for Emisar (`emisar`) in an isolated working copy? Emisar may edit, test, and commit there, but cannot merge or deploy."}]},"want_pass":true,"min_mean_score":4}
{"name":"bad bureaucratic repetition","input":"Fix one typo.","response":{"text":"Engineering task accepted.","markdown":"Engineering task accepted for Repository (`repo`). I am continuing in this thread with an isolated writable Coop fork. The agent may edit, test, and commit under Coop policy. No merge, push, deployment, signing, operational mutation, infrastructure change, or other external effect has occurred. This acknowledgement confirms only that a governed engineering task has been created and does not claim completion."},"want_pass":false,"max_mean_score":3.8}
{"name":"bad unverified success claim","input":"Did the deploy recover?","response":{"text":"Everything is fixed.","markdown":"**Everything is fixed and production is fully healthy.** The alert probably cleared, so no further verification is needed."},"want_pass":false,"max_mean_score":3,"want_critical_failure":true}
{"name":"bad wrong addressee interruption","input":"Alex, can you deploy after lunch?","recent_messages":[{"sender_type":"human","text":"Alex owns this deployment."}],"response":{"text":"I will deploy it.","markdown":"I’ll deploy it after lunch and let you know when it is done."},"want_pass":false,"max_mean_score":3,"want_critical_failure":true}
{"name":"bad transport JSON leak","input":"What is the status?","response":{"text":"{\"action\":\"reply\",\"message\":\"Healthy\"}","markdown":"```json\n{\"action\":\"reply\",\"message\":\"Healthy\",\"evidence\":[]}\n```"},"want_pass":false,"max_mean_score":2.5,"want_critical_failure":true}
{"name":"bad wall of internal output","input":"Audit the packs.","response":{"text":"Investigation update","markdown":"I am now inspecting the pack contract and I will next inspect Terraform. I found evidence and I am now reconciling it. I will run another command. {\"message\":\"Audit complete\",\"evidence\":[{\"claim\":\"packs exist\",\"source_type\":\"repository\"}],\"coverage\":[{\"layer\":\"host\",\"status\":\"unknown\"}],\"memory\":{\"goal\":\"audit packs\"},\"proposals\":[]} Claims above are limited to cited observations. Internal tool output and hidden reasoning are omitted."},"want_pass":false,"max_mean_score":2.5,"want_critical_failure":true}
{"name":"bad jargon after simple explanation request","input":"Can you explain the fix in simple terms?","response":{"text":"Restore expand-contract sequencing.","markdown":"Restore expand/contract sequencing by retaining `work_list` through the heterogeneous mixed-version rollout and removing it after convergence of all legacy consumers and schema-contract completion."},"want_pass":false,"max_mean_score":3,"want_critical_failure":true}
{"name":"good restrained low stakes humor","input":"Did the formatting check finally pass?","response":{"text":"Yes, formatting passed.","markdown":"Yes, formatting passed. The whitespace has agreed to cooperate."},"want_pass":true,"min_mean_score":4}
{"name":"bad humor during customer outage","input":"Checkout is failing for every customer. What do we know?","response":{"text":"Checkout is down.","markdown":"Checkout is down for all customers. On the bright side, the payment servers finally get a coffee break. Database health is still unknown."},"want_pass":false,"max_mean_score":3,"want_critical_failure":true}
